  "title": "小数的减法",
  "printed_title": "59. 小数的减法",
  "start_page": 216,
  "start_printed": 207,
  "figures": [
    {
      "id": "fig-223",
      "label": "图 223",
      "page": 220
    }
  ],
  "exercise_count": 33,
  "prose": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "问题. 钳工学徒每月工资71.35卢布。定级以后每月工资114.8卢布。他的月工资增加了多少？",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 207,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0216#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "为了解这个题，需要从114.8中减去71.35：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 207,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0216#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$114.8-71.35=114.80-71.35=114\\frac{80}{100}-71\\frac{35}{100}=43\\frac{45}{100}=43.45$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 207,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0216#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "每个月的工资增加了43.45卢布。小数的减法也可以方便地写成“竖式”：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 207,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0216#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$\\phantom{-}114.80$ $\\underline{-\\ \\phantom{1}71.35}$ $\\phantom{-1}43.45$",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 207,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0216#8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "一小数减去另一小数，需要：1）使被减数和减数的小数点后面位数相等；2）把减数写在被减数下面并使它们的小数点对齐；3）和自然数的减法一样做减法；4）相减以后，在差的对着被减数和减数小数点的位置上点上小数点。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 207,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0216#9"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
